OL,3,GNEWSAHow climate change is affecting
OL,4,Achildren's wellbeing
OL,5,
OL,6,FMillions of children across the UK say
OL,7,Fclimate change is impacting their
OL,8,Fwellbeing after relentless heatwaves,
OL,9,Fwildfires and flooding.
OL,11,FTeenagers have said this year's extreme
OL,12,Fheat has left them feeling "powerless"
OL,13,Fand "hopeless" for the future, with
OL,14,Fexperts explaining that climate anxiety
OL,15,Fis a sense of fear and worry linked to
OL,16,Fthe changing climate.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
