OL,3,GNEWSAHow climate change is affecting
OL,4,Achildren's wellbeing
OL,5,
OL,6,FRebecca Fulford, 21, from
OL,7,FGloucestershire, said: "Often it feels
OL,8,Flike young people have the most
OL,9,Fexpectation on them to take action.
OL,10,FHowever they also have the least
OL,11,Fpower."
OL,13,FProfessor Dan O'Hare from Bristol
OL,14,FUniversity urged parents to validate
OL,15,Fthe emotions of children who are
OL,16,Fdealing with climate anxiety, warning
OL,17,Fit can leave them feeling isolated.
